# W1, host a (k4): hosts a Public instance in stag0101 and plays there while b joins and leaves.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600 fail stagechange
log b joined a
wander -150 -60 20 until present=1 or sealed>=12000 fail stagechange
log b is gone
idle until frames>=120
